HDU-KillCourse (vendored)
========================

Source: https://github.com/cr4n5/HDU-KillCourse (Apache License 2.0)
Vendored from: local checkout of cr4n5/HDU-KillCourse, v1.4.9 era (2026-07-05)
License: see LICENSE in this directory.

This copy is integrated into HDU-Smart-Course-Agent as a Go module via
`replace github.com/cr4n5/HDU-KillCourse => ./third_party/HDU-KillCourse`.

Local modifications (relative to upstream):
- client/client.go: added BaseJWURL / BaseSSOURL package variables and
  Client.SetHTTPClient so the HTTP client and endpoints can be injected
  for tests and local mocks.
- client/service.go: hard-coded endpoint URLs now use BaseJWURL/BaseSSOURL.
- pkg/course/killCourse.go: SelectCourse/CancelCourse now return an error
  when the school reports failure (upstream only logged it); HandleCourse
  guards against a nil ClientBodyConfig instead of panicking.
- pkg/login/login.go: new-JW login failure detection aligned with the
  school's error message.
